# SELF_AUDIT

## Revision scope

Targeted repair only. The accepted Saga structure was preserved:

- Event ID set unchanged;
- **45 Major roots** unchanged;
- `nodeId`, `parentNodeIds`, `fallback`, `selectionPriority`, `specialPathId` and `milestoneId` metadata unchanged;
- routing scenarios unchanged;
- single-parent lock remains **`female` / mother**;
- Special Association remains **`pirate_fishman_underkeel`**;
- the five proposed inheritance Item IDs remain unchanged.

No Blueprint or Proposed Definitions regeneration was required.

